{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Full Cups: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja53'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 53 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Āsīsavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Hope </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>3. Puṇṇapātijātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Full Cups: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Tatheva puṇṇā pātiyo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The cups stay just as full, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>aññāyaṁ vattate kathā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>while the ignorant talk goes on. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ākāraṇena jānāmi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>For this reason I know </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>na cāyaṁ bhaddikā surā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>this is not an excellent beer. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Puṇṇapātijātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
